# ...except one. A REW session is normally an INPUT to this repository (CONTRIBUTING.md:
# "send either the .mdat or the converted set"), not something published from it — the
# published formats are tool-neutral and diffable. The 2026-09-03 two-ear set is the
# exception on purpose: its question is about PAIRS of microphone positions, and the
# per-driver conversion every other set uses throws the pairing away, so the raw session
# is the only form in which that result can be re-derived. Widen this only for the same
# reason, and say the reason here.
